hadiths[19]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1537","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Ubaidah bin Jarrah, Abu Talhah Ansari aur Ubayy bin Ka'b (Raziyallahu anhum) ko fazeekh aur khajoor se bani hui sharab pila raha tha ke un ke paas ek aane wala aaya aur kaha: Beshak sharab haram kar di gai hai. To Abu Talhah ne farmaya: Aey Anas! Utho aur in matkon ko tod do. Anas ne kaha: To main apne mopne ki taraf utha aur use us ke nichle hisse se mara yahan tak ke woh toot gaen."
"1538","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jis ne duniya mein sharab pi phir us se tauba na ki to woh aakhirat mein is se mehroom rahega.'"
"1539","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) zauja Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Har peene ki cheez jo nasha lae woh haram hai.'"
"1540","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bit' ke bare mein poocha gaya to Aap ne farmaya: 'Har peene ki cheez jo nasha lae woh haram hai.'"
"1541","[AI-translation] Ibn Tawus se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Abu Wahb Jaishani ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bit' ke bare mein poocha to Aap ne farmaya: 'Har nasha aawar cheez haram hai.'"
"1542","[AI-translation] Main ne Abu Juwairiyah Jarmi ko kahte suna: Beshak main pahla Arabi hun jis ne Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se sawal kiya jabke woh Ka'ba se pusht lagaae hue the. To main ne un se baziq ke bare mein poocha. To unhon ne farmaya: Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) baziq se pahle guzar gae, aur jo nasha de woh haram hai."
"1543","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Har nasha dilane wali cheez sharab hai aur har qism ki sharab haram hai."
"1544","[AI-translation] Main ne Rabi' ko kahte suna: Main ne Shafi'i ko kahte suna jabke woh nasha aawar cheez ke zikr mein daleel de rahe the, aur woh guzri hui guftagu thi jo mujhe yaad nahin, to unhon ne farmaya: Batao agar woh dus ghoont piye aur use nasha na ho? Agar woh kahe: Halal. Kaha jae: Batao agar woh nikle aur use hawa lage aur use nasha ho jae? Agar woh kahe: Haram. To us se kaho: Kya tum ne kabhi koi cheez dekhi jo us ne pi aur woh us ke pet mein halal ho kar pahunchi phir hawa ne use haram kar diya? Shafi'i ne farmaya: Jis ka zyada nasha de us ka thoda haram hai."
"1545","[AI-translation] Ata bin Yasar se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ghubaira ke bare mein poocha gaya to Aap ne farmaya: Is mein bhalai nahin hai, aur Aap ne is se mana farmaya. Malik ne kaha: Zaid bin Aslam ne kaha: Woh sukurkah hai."
"1546","[AI-translation] Mahmood bin Labeed Ansari se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) jab Sham aae to Sham walon ne un se waba aur zameen ki garmi ki shikayat ki aur kaha: Hamen is sharab ke siwa aur koi cheez tandrust nahin rakh sakti. To Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Shahad pi liya karo. Unhon ne kaha: Shahad hamen sahat nahin deta. Un mein se ek aadmi ne kaha: Agar ham is sharab ko is haalat par le aaen ke is ka nasha na rahe to aap kya kahte hain? Farmaya: Theek hai. Phir unhon ne use aag par pakaya hatta ke us ke do suls khushk ho gae aur ek suls rah gaya, to woh use Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas lae. Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne is mein apni ungli dali phir apna hath upar uthaya to woh taar ki tarah chipakne laga, unhon ne farmaya: Yeh tila hai, yeh oonton ke tila ki tarah hai. Phir Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne unhen is ke peene ka hukm diya, to Ubadah bin Samit (Raziyallahu anhu) ne un se kaha: Allah ki qasam! Aap ne is ko halal kar diya hai. Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne jawab mein farmaya: Hargiz aisa nahin! Allah ki qasam! Aey Allah! Jo cheez Tune haram kar di hai main use in ke liye halal nahin karta, aur jo Tune in ke liye halal kar diya hai woh main in par haram nahin karta hun."
"1547","[AI-translation] Ma'bad bin Ka'b se, apni maa se aur unhon ne donon qiblon ki taraf munh kar ke namazen padhin riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne do tarah ke mewon ko mila kar nabeez banane se mana kiya aur farmaya: 'Har ek ki alag alag nabeez banao.'"
"1548","[AI-translation] Ata bin Yasar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne chhuware aur neem pukhta khajoor ki ikatthi, aur khushk khajoor aur pakne ke qareeb khajoor ki ikatthi nabeez banane se mana farmaya."
"1549","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Aufa se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sabz, safed aur surkh ghade mein nabeez banane se mana farmaya."
"1550","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kadu se bane hue bartan aur roghni bartan mein nabeez na banao.' Unhon ne kaha: Phir Abu Hurairah farmate the: Tum sabz roghni ghadon aur lakdi ko khod kar banae gae bartanon se bhi ijtinab karo."
"1551","[AI-translation] Zuhri farmate hain ke main ne Anas ko farmate hue suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kadu se bane hue bartan aur roghni ghade mein nabeez banane se mana farmaya."
"1552","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kisi ghazwa mein logon ko khutba diya, Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne farmaya: Main Aap ki taraf mutawajjeh hua aur mere pahunchne se pahle hi Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) wapas tashreef le gae, main ne Sahaba kiram (Raziyallahu anhum) se poocha ke Aap ne kya farmaya? To unhon ne kaha ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kadu se bane hue bartan aur roghni ghade mein nabeez banane se mana farmaya."
"1553","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kadu se bane bartan aur sabz roghni ghade mein nabeez banane se mana farmaya."
"1554","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne bayan farmaya ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne chand bartanon mein nabeez se mana farmaya to Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha gaya, har aadmi ke paas mashkeeza nahin hai. Phir Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sabz roghni ghade ke ilawa aur ghadon mein nabeez banane ki ijazat de di."
"1555","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye nabeez mashkeeze mein bhigoi jati thi, agar woh dastiyab na hota to patthar se bane hue pani peene ke bartan mein bhigoi jati."
